            <title><![CDATA[Why Trump pushed for Jensen Huang's return to Nvidia]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/why-trump-pushed-for-jensen-huangs-return-to-nvidia</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Jensen Huang is back as CEO of Nvidia just two weeks after resigning amid revelations of extramarital affairs, including one with a woman suspected of ties to Chinese intelligence. President Trump personally intervened to push for his reinstatement, saying he believed Huang did nothing wrong. White House correspondent Liz Landers spoke with President Trump before the announcement.]]></description>
